=== SURVEY ===
Shared core public surface = 2221 public decls (295 fun, 263 data class, 140 class, 67 interface,
29 enum, 19 object). Wrap targets are the 114 presentation state holders (one StateFlow<State> +
actions each), NOT the DTOs (KMP exposes data classes to Swift directly).
Seams the facade binds to (read from source):
  - net/ApiError.kt           sealed ApiError: Network | Timeout | Http(status,body?,code?) | Decode | CircuitOpen
  - data/repo/Resource.kt     sealed Resource<T>: Loading(cached,fetchedAt,stale) | Success(data,fetchedAt,stale) | Error(cached,…,error); cached:T?, stale:Bool
  - net/sse/LiveEvent.kt      Connection{Connecting,Open,Reconnecting,Stale,Closed}; LiveEvent: Connected|Heartbeat|VehicleUpdate|Alert|ExportStatus|AchievementUnlocked|Signal|Unknown
  - units/Units.kt            convert{Distance,Speed,Temp,Pressure,Energy,Duration,Power}FromSI(value, to:<Quantity>UnitPref):Double;
                              format*(value:Double?, pref:UnitPref, precision:Int?):String; UnitPref(distance,speed,…,locale?,precision?,emptyDisplay?);
                              <Quantity>UnitPref enums with label + companion fromLabel(label)
  - platform/Platform.kt      object Platform.name (proves link; already exercised by P0)
Golden fixtures: apps/shared/spec/units-golden.json = [{fn,formatter,quantity,system,input_si,preference{…,locale},expected_value,expected_formatted}].
No shared-core DI root exists → the facade owns the composition root (AppContainer.bootstrap, finalized on macOS build).

=== REASONING ===
- Generic-first (DRY): one Flow→AsyncThrowingStream bridge + one @Observable StateHolderModel
  natively bridge ANY of the 114 holders, so "all domains" are supported by construction.
  Rejected 114 bespoke wrappers (mechanical, low value, 114× the blind-symbol risk).
- Errors: KMP ApiError → Swift FacadeError (+ auth/offline/cancelled), handling both direct
  bridging and NSError.userInfo["KotlinException"] unwrap (K/N @Throws convention).
- State: Resource<T> → LoadableState<Value> (idle/loading/loaded/empty/failed + stale + cached),
  so views render loading/empty/error/stale uniformly; all UI mutations on @MainActor.
- Units: thin Swift wrappers over SharedUnitsKt; enums built via fromLabel(label) (robust — uses
  the source's label strings, avoids guessing Swift enum-case spelling).
- Domain facades wrap an INJECTED holder (construction isolated to AppContainer), so domain code
  never names a shared-core constructor → the blind surface stays inside one file.
- Concurrency: generic Value/State are NOT constrained Sendable (KMP bridged types aren't Sendable);
  strict-concurrency annotations are finalized on the macOS build.

=== CHANGES ===  (apps/apple/Sources/SharedFacade/** unless noted — inferred KMP symbols centralized here)
  + FacadeError.swift                 ApiError→FacadeError taxonomy + NSError/KotlinException unwrap
  + LoadableState.swift               Resource<T>→LoadableState<Value> (loading/loaded/empty/failed + stale/cached)
  + FlowBridge.swift                  Kotlin Flow → AsyncThrowingStream (Task-cancellation closes upstream collector)
  + StateHolderModel.swift            generic @MainActor @Observable adapter over any StateFlow — the universal bind point
  + Units+Facade.swift                UnitPreferences + Units.{convert,format}* over SharedUnitsKt (enums via fromLabel)
  + LiveConnection.swift              Connection→LiveConnectionState; LiveEvent taxonomy → LiveEventKind
  + AppContainer.swift                @Observable composition root: unitPreferences, platformName, model()/loadable() factories
  + Domains/VehicleSettingsModel.swift  representative typed facade adapting an injected VehicleSettingsStore
  + Tests/Unit/Facade/LoadableStateTests.swift       pure-Swift LoadableState + FacadeError retryability
  + Tests/Unit/Facade/UnitsGoldenVectorTests.swift   runs apps/shared/spec/units-golden.json through the Units facade
  + Tests/Unit/Facade/FacadeErrorMappingTests.swift  ApiError→FacadeError mapping incl. KotlinException unwrap
